.TH "whipper-drive" "1" "2020" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
whipper-drive \- Drive utilities
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
whipper drive [\fBsubcommand\fP]
whipper drive \fB\-h\fP
.fi
.sp
.SH Subcommands
.nf
\fBanalyze\fP  Analyze caching behaviour of drive
\fBlist\fP     List drives
.fi
.sp
.nf
For more details on these subcommands, see their respective man pages.
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
